        1617,
        1977,
        2120
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "By April 15th, please notify this Office (attn. Citizen Feedback Unit) of the name of an appropriate management level official whom you are designating to coordinate your agency's implementation of these Guidelines. By May 1st, please submit to the Citizen Feedback Unit a detailed statement of existing and proposed procedures for handling citizen complaints and requests in accordance with the attached Guidelines document. Agencies should also be prepared to participate in training seminars, as outlined, by June 1st.",
